#: .\templates\landing\about.html:5
msgid "About Us - CattleCare AI"
msgstr "Mayelana lathi - CattleCare AI"

#: .\templates\landing\about.html:192
msgid "About CattleCare AI"
msgstr "Mayelana ne-CattleCare AI"

#: .\templates\landing\about.html:193
msgid ""
"We combine artificial intelligence and veterinary expertise to protect "
"cattle and support Zimbabwean farmers."
msgstr ""
"Sihlangamisa ingqondo yomshini lobuchwepheshe bezinyanga zezilwane ukuze "
"sivikelane izinkomo futhi sisekele abalimi baseZimbabwe."

#: .\templates\landing\about.html:200
msgid "Our Mission & Vision"
msgstr "Umsebenzi wethu & Umbono wethu"

#: .\templates\landing\about.html:201
msgid ""
"CattleCare AI was built to reduce livestock losses and improve animal health "
"through early disease detection and timely veterinary support."
msgstr ""
"I-CattleCare AI yakhiwa ukunciphisa ukulahleka kwezilwane nokuthuthukisa "
"impilo yezilwane ngokubona izifo ngaphambi kwesikhathi kanye nolekelelo "
"lwedokotela wezilwane ngesikhathi."

#: .\templates\landing\about.html:206
msgid "Mission"
msgstr "Inhloso"

#: .\templates\landing\about.html:207
msgid ""
"To empower every farmer in Zimbabwe with AI-powered early disease prediction "
"and instant access to qualified veterinarians, so that cattle health is "
"protected and livelihoods are secured."
msgstr ""
"Ukunika amandla umlimi ngamunye eZimbabwe ngokubikezela izifo nge-AI kanye "
"nokufinyelela ngokushesha ezinyangeni zezilwane eziqualified, ukuze impilo "
"yezinkomo ivikelwe futhi imiphilo igcinwe."

#: .\templates\landing\about.html:213
msgid "Vision"
msgstr "Umbono"

#: .\templates\landing\about.html:214
msgid ""
"A Zimbabwe where no farmer loses cattle to preventable diseases because of "
"late detection or lack of veterinary care. We aim to be the national "
"platform for livestock health intelligence."
msgstr ""
"IZimbabwe lapho kungekho mlimi owelahlekelwa yinkomo ngezifo ezingavinjelwa "
"ngenxa yokubonwa kwemuva noma ukunganakekelwa yidokotela wezilwane. Sihlosa "
"ukuba yindawo yesizwe yokulazi kwempilo yezilwane."

#: .\templates\landing\about.html:220
msgid "Values"
msgstr "Amagugu"

#: .\templates\landing\about.html:221
msgid ""
"Accuracy, accessibility, and trust. We use robust machine learning models, "
"keep the platform available 24/7, and work with Ministry-approved vets so "
"farmers get reliable support."
msgstr ""
"Ubuqiniso, ukufinyelela, nokwethembeka. Sisebenzisa amamodeli anamandla "
"okufunda kwemishini, sigcina inkundla itholakala 24/7, futhi sisebenza "
"nezinyanga zezilwane eziamukiwe uMnyango ukuze abalimi bathole usizo "
"olwethembakele."

#: .\templates\landing\about.html:231
msgid "Why CattleCare AI?"
msgstr "Kungani i-CattleCare AI?"

#: .\templates\landing\about.html:232
msgid ""
"Livestock is central to many Zimbabwean families. Disease outbreaks can wipe "
"out herds and income. We built this system to change that."
msgstr ""
"Izilwane zibaluleke kakhulu emindenini eminingi yaseZimbabwe. Izifo eziphuma "
"zinengi zingabhubhisa amahlambi kanye nemali. Sakha lo mhlelo ukushintsha "
"lokho."

#: .\templates\landing\about.html:237
msgid "Early Detection Saves Herds"
msgstr "Ukubonwa Okusebenzayo Kusindisa Imihlambi"

#: .\templates\landing\about.html:238
msgid ""
"Many cattle diseases can be treated or contained if caught early. Our AI "
"analyzes symptoms and predicts likely diseases so farmers can act quickly—"
"often before a vet can physically visit."
msgstr ""
"Izifo eziningi zezinkomo zingaphulukiswa noma zivinjelwe uma zibanjiwa "
"ekuqaleni. I-AI yethu ihlaziya izimpawu ibese ibikezela izifo ezingenzeka "
"ukuze abalimi benze ngokushesha—kuvame ngaphambi kwenyanga yezilwane ukuze "
"ihambe."

#: .\templates\landing\about.html:244
msgid "Connecting Farmers and Vets"
msgstr "Ukuxhumanisa Abalimi Nezingcweti"

#: .\templates\landing\about.html:245
msgid ""
"Rural farmers often lack easy access to veterinarians. CattleCare AI links "
"farmers with Ministry-approved vets, supports remote consultation, and helps "
"vets prioritize critical cases."
msgstr ""
"Abalimi basezindaweni zasemakhaya kaningi baswele ukufinyelela okulula koza "
"bedokotela wezilwane. I-CattleCare AI ixhumanisa abalimi nezingcweti "
"ezivunyelwe yi-Ministry, isekela ukubonisana kude, futhi isiza izingcweti "
"ukuphatha amacansi abalulekile."

#: .\templates\landing\about.html:255
msgid "Our Impact"
msgstr "Umthelela wethu"

#: .\templates\landing\about.html:256
msgid "Numbers that show our commitment to livestock health."
msgstr "Amanombolo abonisa ukuzinikela kwethu empilweni yezilwane."

#: .\templates\landing\about.html:261
msgid "Prediction Accuracy"
msgstr "Ukulunga kokulinga"

#: .\templates\landing\about.html:267 .\templates\landing\home.html:687
#: .\templates\vets\register.html:614
msgid "Availability"
msgstr "Ukutholakala"

#: .\templates\landing\about.html:273 .\templates\landing\home.html:691
msgid "Verified Vets"
msgstr "Izingcweti eziqinisekisiwe"

#: .\templates\landing\about.html:279
msgid "Provinces Covered"
msgstr "Izifundazwe ezikhethiwe"

#: .\templates\landing\about.html:289
msgid "Ministry of Agriculture Partnership"
msgstr "Ubambiswano loMnyango wezolimo"

#: .\templates\landing\about.html:290
msgid ""
"CattleCare AI supports the Ministry of Agriculture with real-time disease "
"surveillance and data to inform vaccination campaigns and livestock health "
"policy across Zimbabwe."
msgstr ""
"I-CattleCare AI isekela uMnyango wezolimo ngokuqapha izifo ngesikhathi "
"sangempela kanye nedatha yokuazisa imizamo yokugoma kanye nenqubomgomo "
"yezempilo yezilwane eZimbabwe yonke."

#: .\templates\landing\about.html:295
msgid "National Dashboard"
msgstr "Ideshibhodi yesizwe"

#: .\templates\landing\about.html:298
msgid ""
"Ministry staff can monitor disease trends, outbreak hotspots, and vet "
"coverage. This helps plan vaccinations, quarantine zones, and resource "
"allocation so that livestock health is protected at scale."
msgstr ""
"Izisebenzi ze-Ministry zingaqapha izifo ezizikhona, izindawo ezibalulekile "
"zokuphuma kwezifo, kanye nokubhekwa kwezingcweti. Lokhu kusiza ukuhlelwa "
"kwemithinjwa, izindawo zokuqhamuka, kanye nokuhlela izinsiza ukuze impilo "
"yezilwane ivikelwe ngescale esikhulu."

#: .\templates\landing\about.html:309
msgid "Join farmers and vets already using CattleCare AI."
msgstr "Joyina abalimi nezingcweti abasebenzisa i-CattleCare AI."

