#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:10
msgid "Vet Help Center"
msgstr "Isikhungo sosizo lwengcwethi"

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:12
msgid ""
"Short guide for vet doctors on how to use the CattleCare AI dashboard, "
"manage cases, and communicate with the Ministry."
msgstr ""
"Umhlahlandlela omfutshane wamadokotela ezilwane wokusebenzisa ideshibhodi ye-"
"CattleCare AI, ukuphatha amacansi, kanye lokuxhumana le-Ministry."

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:18
msgid "Your quick stats"
msgstr "Izibalo zakho ezisheshayo"

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:22
msgid "Open (Assigned + In progress):"
msgstr "Okusavuliweyo (Okumiselweyo + Okuqhubekayo):"

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:31
msgid "1. Understanding your vet dashboard"
msgstr "1. Ukuqonda ideshibhodi yakho yengcwethi"

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:34
msgid "Header bar (top of the page)"
msgstr "Ibha ephezulu (phezulu kwekhasi)"

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:36
msgid ""
"<strong>Date range &amp; new cases graph</strong>: shows when new cases were "
"received. Blue points = days with at least one new case."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Isikhathi & ishadi lamacansi amatsha</strong>: libonisa nxa amacansi "
"amatsha emukelwe. Amachaphaza aluhlaza okwesibhakabhaka = izinsuku "
"ezilecansi elitsha okungenani elilodwa."

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:37
msgid ""
"<strong>View all cases</strong>: opens the full list of cases assigned to "
"you, grouped by status."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Bona wonke amacansi</strong>: kuvula uhlu olupheleleyo lwamacansi "
"amiselwe kuwe, luhlelwe ngesimo."

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:38
msgid ""
"<strong>Export</strong>: downloads all your cases as a CSV file that you can "
"open in Excel."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Khipha</strong>: kulanda wonke amacansi akho njengefayela le-CSV "
"ongayivula ku-Excel."

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:41
msgid "Key cards (top of dashboard)"
msgstr "Amakhadi abalulekileyo (phezulu kwedeshibhodi)"

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:43
msgid ""
"<strong>Farmers Assigned</strong>: number of unique farmers you have served. "
"Click “View farmers” to see recent farmers and their cases."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Abalimi abamiswe</strong>: inani labalimi abahlukileyo osubancedile. "
"Chofoza “Bona abalimi” ukubona abalimi bakamuva lamacansi abo."

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:44
msgid ""
"<strong>Total Cases Solved</strong>: all cases you have resolved or closed."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Wonke amacansi axazululiwe</strong>: wonke amacansi owaxazulula "
"kumbe owawavala."

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:45
msgid ""
"<strong>Total Cases Assigned</strong>: all cases that were ever assigned to "
"you."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Wonke amacansi amiselwe</strong>: wonke amacansi ake amiselwa kuwe."

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:46
msgid ""
"<strong>Critical Cases</strong>: active cases with critical severity that "
"need urgent attention."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Amacansi asengozini</strong>: amacansi asebenzayo anobunzima "
"obukhulu adinga ukunakwa okuphuthumayo."

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:49
msgid "Case Statistics (big graph)"
msgstr "Izibalo zamacansi (ishadi elikhulu)"

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:51
msgid "Shows <strong>new cases per day</strong> for the last 12 months."
msgstr ""
"Libonisa <strong>amacansi amatsha ngosuku</strong> ezinyangeni ezili-12 "
"ezedlule."

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:52
msgid ""
"Hover a point to see the <strong>exact date</strong> and the number of new "
"cases you received that day."
msgstr ""
"Beka igundane phezu kwephuzu ukubona <strong>usuku oluqondileyo</strong> "
"kanye lenani lamacansi amatsha owawathola ngalolosuku."

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:55
msgid "Resolution Rate card"
msgstr "Ikhadi lezinga lokuxazulula"

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:57
#, python-format
msgid "<strong>Big %%</strong> = overall resolution rate for all your cases."
msgstr ""
"<strong>%% enkulu</strong> = izinga lokuxazulula elipheleleyo kuwo wonke "
"amacansi akho."

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:58
msgid ""
"Green text below shows <strong>how many cases you have resolved this month</"
"strong>."
msgstr ""
"Umbhalo oluhlaza ngaphansi ubonisa <strong>ukuthi mangaki amacansi "
"owaxazulule kulinyanga</strong>."

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:59
msgid ""
"The green mini-graph shows your <strong>monthly resolution rate over the "
"last 12 months</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Ishadi elincane eliluhlaza libonisa <strong>izinga lakho lokuxazulula "
"ngenyanga ezinyangeni ezili-12 ezedlule</strong>."

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:62
msgid "Assigned cases table (bottom)"
msgstr "Ithebula lamacansi amiselweyo (phansi)"

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:64
msgid ""
"Each row is a case with <strong>date, farmer name, predicted disease, "
"severity and status</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Umugqa ngamunye yicansi eline <strong>usuku, ibizo lomlimi, isifo "
"esibikezelweyo, ubunzima kanye lesimo</strong>."

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:65
msgid ""
"Click <strong>“View”</strong> to open the case detail page, enter your "
"diagnosis and recommendations, and then mark the case as resolved when "
"appropriate."
msgstr ""
"Chofoza <strong>“Bona”</strong> ukuvula ikhasi lemininingwane yecansi, faka "
"ukuhlola kwakho lezincomo, bese uphawula icansi njengelixazululiweyo nxa "
"sekufanele."

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:72
msgid "2. Working with cases step by step"
msgstr "2. Ukusebenza lamacansi isinyathelo ngesinyathelo"

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:75
msgid ""
"<strong>Open your case list</strong>: Use the sidebar <strong>“Cases”</"
"strong> link to see all assigned, in‑progress, and resolved cases."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Vula uhlu lwamacansi</strong>: Sebenzisa isixhumanisi seceleni "
"<strong>“Amacansi”</strong> ukubona wonke amacansi amiselwe, okuqhubekayo, "
"kanye laxazululiweyo."

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:77
msgid ""
"<strong>Review farmer information</strong>: From the dashboard or the "
"<strong>“Farmers”</strong> menu, you can see which farmers are under your "
"care and their recent cases."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Hlola ulwazi lomlimi</strong>: Kusukela kwideshibhodi kumbe kwimenyu "
"<strong>“Abalimi”</strong>, ungabona abalimi abasekelweni lwakho lamacansi "
"abo akamuva."

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:79
msgid ""
"<strong>Open a case detail</strong>: Click <strong>“View”</strong> on any "
"case to see: symptoms, predicted disease, severity, farm location and farmer "
"contact information."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Vula imininingwane yecansi</strong>: Chofoza <strong>“Bona”</strong> "
"kucansi loba yiliphi ukubona: izimpawu, isifo esibikezelweyo, ubunzima, "
"indawo yefamu kanye lolwazi lokuxhumana lomlimi."

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:82
msgid ""
"<strong>Record your diagnosis and recommendations</strong>: Use the form on "
"the case detail page to enter your professional diagnosis and clear "
"treatment recommendations (dosage, quarantine, follow‑up, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Bhala ukuhlola kwakho lezincomo</strong>: Sebenzisa ifomu ekhasini "
"lemininingwane yecansi ukufaka ukuhlola kwakho kobungcwethi kanye lezincomo "
"ezicacileyo zokwelapha (amadose, ukuvalela, ukulandelela, njll.)."

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:84
msgid ""
"<strong>Update status</strong>: When you finish, mark the case as "
"<strong>“Resolved”</strong> / <strong>“Closed”</strong> so that the farmer "
"and Ministry can see that the case has been attended."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Vuselela isimo</strong>: Nxa usuqedile, phawula icansi njenge "
"<strong>“Lixazululiwe”</strong> / <strong>“Livaliwe”</strong> ukuze umlimi "
"kanye le-Ministry babone ukuthi icansi seliphathwe."

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:93
msgid "3. Communicating with Ministry"
msgstr "3. Ukuxhumana le-Ministry"

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:96
msgid "Requesting vaccines / medical stock"
msgstr "Ukucela imithinjwa / impahla yezokwelapha"

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:98
msgid "In the sidebar, click <strong>“Request vaccines”</strong>."
msgstr "Eceleni, chofoza <strong>“Cela imithinjwa”</strong>."

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:99
msgid ""
"Fill in the <strong>title</strong>, product name, estimated quantity, "
"<strong>priority</strong> (Normal or Urgent), and a clear justification "
"(disease, area, herd size)."
msgstr ""
"Gcwalisa <strong>isihloko</strong>, ibizo lomkhiqizo, inani "
"elilinganiselweyo, <strong>ukuqakatheka</strong> (Okuvamile kumbe "
"Okuphuthumayo), kanye lesizatho esicacileyo (isifo, indawo, ubukhulu "
"bomhlambi)."

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:100
msgid ""
"After you submit, you can see the <strong>status and Ministry response</"
"strong> in the same page."
msgstr ""
"Emva kokuthumela, ungabona <strong>isimo kanye lempendulo ye-Ministry</"
"strong> ekhasini elifanayo."

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:103
msgid "Writing area reports"
msgstr "Ukubhala imibiko yendawo"

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:105
msgid "Use the <strong>“Area reports”</strong> link in the sidebar."
msgstr "Sebenzisa isixhumanisi se <strong>“Imibiko yendawo”</strong> eceleni."

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:106
msgid ""
"Send <strong>monthly or outbreak reports</strong> describing disease trends, "
"challenges and your recommendations for the area."
msgstr ""
"Thumela <strong>imibiko yenyanga kumbe eyokuqhamuka kwesifo</strong> echaza "
"ukuhamba kwezifo, ubunzima, kanye lezincomo zakho zendawo."

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:107
msgid ""
"Ministry can respond to these reports; you will see their feedback in the "
"same list."
msgstr ""
"I-Ministry ingaphendula kulemibiko; uzabona impendulo yabo kulolo luhlu."

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:110
msgid "What information is most helpful?"
msgstr "Yiluphi ulwazi olunceda kakhulu?"

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:112
msgid "Clear description of <strong>clinical signs</strong> you are observing."
msgstr ""
"Incazelo ecacileyo ye <strong>izibonakaliso zempilakahle</strong> ozibonayo."

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:113
msgid "Approximate <strong>number of affected animals</strong> and herds."
msgstr ""
"Inani elilinganiselweyo le <strong>izilwane ezithintekayo</strong> kanye "
"lemihlambi."

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:114
msgid "Any <strong>suspected disease</strong> based on your experience."
msgstr ""
"Noma yisiphi <strong>isifo osolisayo</strong> ngokusekelwe kulwazi lwakho."

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:115
msgid ""
"Urgency: is this a <strong>local outbreak</strong> or a <strong>wider "
"regional trend</strong>?"
msgstr ""
"Ukuphuthuma: lokhu <strong>ukuqhamuka kwesifo endaweni</strong> kumbe "
"<strong>umkhuba omkhulu wesifunda</strong>?"

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:122
msgid "4. Tips for using CattleCare AI effectively"
msgstr "4. Amacebiso okusebenzisa i-CattleCare AI kuhle"

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:125
msgid ""
"<strong>Confirm AI predictions</strong> with your clinical judgement – the "
"system is a support tool, not a replacement for your expertise."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Qinisekisa okubikezelwa yi-AI</strong> ngokwahlulela kwakho "
"kobungcwethi – uhlelo luyinsiza yokusekela, hhayi ukubuyisela ulwazi lwakho."

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:126
msgid ""
"<strong>Keep statuses up to date</strong> (Assigned → In progress → "
"Resolved) so that Ministry and farmers can see real‑time progress."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Gcina izimo zivuselelwa</strong> (Okumiselweyo → Okuqhubekayo → "
"Okuxazululiweyo) ukuze i-Ministry labalimi babone intuthuko ngesikhathi "
"sangempela."

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:127
msgid ""
"<strong>Use clear language</strong> in recommendations so farmers can follow "
"treatment safely."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Sebenzisa ulimi olucacileyo</strong> kuzincumo ukuze abalimi "
"balandele ukwelatshwa ngokuphepha."

#: .\templates\vets\help_center.html:128
msgid ""
"<strong>Export your cases</strong> regularly if you need to keep personal "
